# what a run of this app leaves in its own folder, and nothing the app is made of: the SQLite file
# of a dev run (`next dev` from these sources, asbl/ci/dp-ci.sh), and the empty mount points Docker
# creates here for the nested mounts of the compose service when the folder is bind-mounted into it.
/data/
/config/
/workspace/
